This is an independent third-party client plugin for DeepSeek Harness (DSH).
It is not affiliated with, or endorsed by, DeepSeek.

Parts of the approval interaction behavior (composer takeover, Enter/Escape
handling, and looking up the command of the correlated tool call) are adapted
from the following DSH packages, which are licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0:

  - @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-approval
  - @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-chat

The plugin bundles no code from those packages; it talks to them only through
their public browser APIs (slots, locale, uiSession, useChat standard hook).
